A full-width, dismissible banner for announcements. Pass `message` and, optionally, `href`/`linkLabel` for a call-to-action link. Dismissal is local component state — pair it with your own persistence (e.g. `localStorage`) if it should stay dismissed across visits.

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
  import AnnouncementBar from "$lib/components/blocks/announcement-bar.svelte";
</script>

<AnnouncementBar message="We just shipped a new design system." href="/docs/changelog" />
```
